# VMS-41R1 calibration replay audit checklist

- [ ] Manifest binds the exact six data files, protocol hash, sizes and SHA-256 values.
- [ ] Fixture root, every member and the final file set reject symlinks/nonregular files.
- [ ] Candidate and acceptable bases pass their strict V2 parsers before mutation.
- [ ] Mutation DSL permits only canonical existing-target replace/remove operations.
- [ ] Materialized inputs, mutation arrays and evaluations receive independent hashes.
- [ ] Every scenario compares all frozen evidence axes, not only one total verdict.
- [ ] File-effect actions are restricted to a temporary root; outside cases are event-only.
- [ ] Calibration is permanently DEVELOPMENT_ONLY and exports explicit nonclaims.
- [ ] No model, Solver, DB, Redis or network call is reachable from this runner.
